{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42913","headline":"巢燕 · 胡玢","name":"巢燕","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"燕来巢我檐，我屋非高大。\n所贵儿童善，保尔无殃祸。\n莫巢孀妇家，孀妇怨孤坐。\n妬尔长双飞，打尔危巢破。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"胡玢","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_42913.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42913","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}